sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reporter
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL auth
  participant MailWorker as Auth Mail Worker
  participant Notify as Notification Service
  participant Mongo as MongoDB
  participant EmailWorker as Email Worker
  participant Gmail as Gmail API

  Reporter->>GW: POST /auth/forgot-password with email
  GW->>GW: Apply IP and email rate limits
  GW->>Auth: Forward public recovery request
  Auth->>PG: Find active account and save token hash plus mail outbox
  PG-->>Auth: Transaction committed
  Auth-->>GW: Generic response whether account exists or not
  GW-->>Reporter: 200 Reset link will be sent if account exists

  loop Every 2 seconds
    MailWorker->>PG: Poll pending auth mail outbox
    PG-->>MailWorker: Reset email payload
  end
  MailWorker->>Notify: POST /internal/password-reset over internal REST
  Notify->>Mongo: Store recovery email record
  Mongo-->>Notify: Record stored
  Notify-->>MailWorker: 202 Accepted
  opt EMAIL_MODE is gmail
    loop Every 3 seconds
      EmailWorker->>Mongo: Lease pending recovery email
      Mongo-->>EmailWorker: Recipient and reset link
    end
    EmailWorker->>Gmail: Send reset email over HTTPS with OAuth2
    Gmail-->>EmailWorker: Message id
    EmailWorker->>Mongo: Mark SENT or schedule retry
  end

  Reporter->>GW: POST /auth/reset-password with token and new password
  GW->>Auth: Forward public reset request
  Auth->>PG: Verify token hash expiry account state and tokenVersion
  alt Reset token is valid
    Auth->>PG: Update password and increment tokenVersion
    Auth->>PG: Delete reset token and pending mail
    PG-->>Auth: Password changed and sessions revoked
    Auth-->>GW: 200 Please sign in again
    GW-->>Reporter: Password reset successful
  else Reset token is invalid or expired
    Auth-->>GW: 400 Invalid or expired reset link
    GW-->>Reporter: Request a new reset link
  end
